id too-much-fraud
title Why You Want Ron Conway as an Investor
year 2011
source Paul Graham
kind email
image tooMuchFraud.png
context https://x.com/breckyunits/status/2107991892432650680
transcript
 P
 [ycfounders] Why you want Ron Conway as an investor »
 Founders x
 Paul Graham pg@ycombinator.com via googlegroups.com
 to ycfounders, Ron -
 Unsubscribe
 Thu, Dec 22, 2011, 1:53 PM
 This morning I woke up to find an email from a company we'd funded,
 saying their bank had decided their business had too much fraud
 risk, and that they were going to hold onto their money for several
 months before releasing it. The company has such rapid turnover
 that this would have killed them within days.
 I asked Ron Conway if he could fix the problem. He contacted the
 CEO of the bank (and not some local bank; this is a giant, national
 bank). By 3:30 this afternoon the problem was fixed.
 And 3 days before Christmas too, when most other investors are off
 on ski trips.
 --pg
