 ------ Forwarded message ------
 From: Jeff <jeff@polleverywhere.com>
 Date: Sat, Apr 17, 2010 at 12:24 PM
 Subject: Equity Split Survey
 To: Paul Graham <pg@ycombinator.com>
 Hey Paul -
 Would you mind sending this to the YC list? I could post it too, but
 I'm hoping that with your encouragement we'll get higher
 participation. The results of this research should be especially
 useful to new founders that have no idea how to split their equity,
 and what the effects of that decision might be.
 Founders and Alumni -
 I was fascinated to learn that when controlling for other correlated
 factors, research shows that investors give lower valuations to
 companies that have split their equity equally among the founding
 team.
 Would you take this short 10 question anonymous survey about your
 feelings on equity splits and incentives? Those who participate will
 be given access to the aggregated results.
 http://www.polleverywhere.com/survey/eeb9aLJTH
 Thanks!
 Jeff Vyduna
