 Hi all,
 My cofounder Evan Beard and I (W2010) are building Etacts (http://etacts.com), a personal CRM app. Etacts helps you stay in
 touch with your contacts by importing your existing phone calls and emails to automatically figure out whom you haven't spoken
 with. We also allow you to track the emails you've sent that are waiting on a response (http://etacts.com/bookmarklet/).
 Please take a few minutes to try out the app. Just go to http://etacts.com and enter your existing Gmail or Google Apps account
 (i.e. howietl@gmail.com) and your gmail account password to discover which of your contacts you're out of touch with. Your
 passwords are securely encrypted in our database and we take the utmost care to respect and protect your privacy.
 Feel free to send us feedback directly (founders@etacts.com or
 3) or using this form:
 http://howietl.wufoo.com/forms/etacts-feedback-2l
 Please feel free to pass this along to anybody you know who juggles many relationships: schmoozers, people in business
 development, etc. However, we're hoping to avoid blog or press coverage until we launch formally.
 Really appreciate your time!
 Howie
