 Breck Yunits <breck7@gmail.com>
 to Paul y
 Wed, Nov 4, 2009, 1:07PM * ©
 To fund Alex Andon, yes. Is JellyfishArt a tech startup or would it be a fit for YC? A few months ago I would say no easily. But lately
 I'm not so sure. He's getting many thousands of visitors a month now from organic SEO. I don't know anything about the online pet
 industry but I do know it's big and he's got a foothold. I could see him eventually becoming a much bigger online pet store than just
 jellyfish. Or maybe just being the profitable leader in that space. Not sure what his long term plans are. I don't know where you draw
 the line between a sector you'll try and one you won't, but he's a solid entrepreneur and worth an interview.

